  "description": "\"At the same day and hour, three children who should not be born will be born.\nAmong them, one child holds everyone’s fate; depending on that child’s choice, one family will be annihilated and the child will die in the child’s own form.\nI, Theodoric, stake everything and curse this.\"\n\nLike a curse, at that same day and hour, Mikael, Ezra, and Flora are born.\n\nThe three, as if by predetermined fate, eventually come face to face, and Flora must choose between the two...\n\n(Source: MangaDex)",
